 close to what game situations call for. Daniel Jones has run the passing game, with Josh Downs leading the team in targets.","defense":"The Colts defense has been a little below average by EPA allowed per play so far. Even its strongest area, success rate allowed, only ranks 13th, and it is 31st in takeaways per game. DeForest Buckner leads the team with 4 sacks, and Adetomiwa Adebawore has added 4 despite playing only 36% of the snaps. In terms of scheme, they have the 2nd lowest blitz rate in the league.","special":"The Colts have been about average in how often they go for it on fourth down. Their kickers have made 90% of field goals, which is a little above average. On the roster side, they put an unusually large share of their salary cap into the secondary, about 29% of the money on the books. Their tight ends were among the oldest in the league.","players":"Daniel Jones has played nearly every snap at quarterback and thrown for 1,398 yards. Targets have been spread around, with Josh Downs and Keenan Allen leading a group where nobody has more than a fifth of the looks. Jonathan Taylor has handled most of the work in the backfield with 78% of the carries. On defense, DeForest Buckner leads the team with 4 sacks.","coaching":"Shane Steichen is calling the offense as head coach and Lou Anarumo is calling the defense. Their offense looks most like the 2023 Browns under Kevin Stefanski and the 2023 Packers under Matt LaFleur. Their defense looks most like the 2022 Saints under Dennis Allen and the 2023 Seahawks.","trends":"The offense went from 9th in EPA per play in 2025 to 27th so far this season, a big step back. The defense moved from 16th in EPA allowed per play in 2025 to 22nd so far this season, a modest decline. The biggest change in approach was blitz rate, which went from 28% to 22%.","notes":"The 2026 pages are built from data that nflverse updates every week, so they will keep changing until the season ends. Personnel, formations, coverage and pressure numbers are missing for now because that data is only released after the season."}}